  "spec": {
    "summary": "Real dogfood ratio is ~9 events/ticket, so the parked 5k-file threshold arrives at ~550 tickets (about two weeks of active use). Shard events/ into YYYY-MM subdirectories, fingerprint per shard so unchanged months are not re-scanned, and migrate any flat layout on reindex.",
